      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pulaski%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Pulaski’s downtown lies on the north side of Richland Creek, a tributary that feeds the Elk River system.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
